    "description": "Muro Corporation manufactures and sells metal and resin-related parts, and other related products in Japan. The company provides automotive electrification parts, powertrain parts, and steering and control parts, such as oil pump sprocket, sprocket, cam pilot, gear ring, gear sun, angle sensor, gear sprocket, gear pulsar, and insert and resin gear products. It also offers forged gear, rotor magnet end plate, adapter, peeler, and sprocket drive-related products. In addition, the company offers binding and support bands for gardening; plastic molded parts for automobiles and cameras; and screw tightening machines and screw fasteners. The company serves vehicles, automobiles, electric bicycles, recreational vehicles, and industrial engine sectors. The company was formerly known as Muro-Kinzoku Kogyo Co, LTD. and changed its name to Muro Corporation in March 1990. Muro Corporation was founded in 1953 and is headquartered in Utsunomiya, Japan."
